<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2014/Dylan.jpg" alt="A portrait of a black dog with partially finished gray background" width="450" height="528" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Dylan. 14x11, oil on linen panel. 2014.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I finished working on this commissioned portrait of Dylan today. Like all black dog portraits this was difficult to get right: before starting I changed the curves of each primary color in the original photograph to give me a broader range of hues to use. I also did a full value monochrome block in to help support the darks.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Edit: I added a little more paint to the unpainted foreground areas.</p>